      "text": "## The Big Picture"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-MLOPS.md#004",
      "path": [
        "05-MLOPS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:data-science:05-mlops, git-history:data-science:05-mlops]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/05-MLOPS.md",
        "concepts": "[mlops]",
        "current_path": "data-science/05-MLOPS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:mlops",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mlops]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - MLOps",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         MLOPS LIFECYCLE                                     │\n│                                                                             │\n│  DATA        TRAINING         EVALUATION      DEPLOYMENT      MONITORING    │\n│                                                                             │\n│  ┌────────┐  ┌────────────┐  ┌────────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐     │\n│  │ ingest │→ │ experiment │→ │   eval /   │→ │  model   │→ │  drift   │  │\n│  │ validate│  │  track    │  │  register  │  │  serve   │  │  monitor │  │\n│  │ version│  │            │  │            │  │          │  │  retrain │  │\n│  └────────┘  └────────────┘  └────────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  │\n│       │             │               │               │              │        │\n│  DVC/       MLflow/W&B         MLflow            BentoML/       Evidently  │\n│  Great       Experiment        Model             Seldon/        / Arize    │\n│  Expectations  Tracking        Registry          FastAPI        / WhyLabs  │\n│                                                  + K8s                     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-MLOPS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "05-MLOPS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:data-science:05-mlops, git-history:data-science:05-mlops]",
