        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - MLOps",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The key difference from standard DevOps: **a model is correct only relative to\na data distribution**. Redeploying identical code with new data can produce worse\nbehavior. This requires versioning data, not just code."
    },
