        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - MLOps",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Without tracking, ML experiments are ephemeral. You run 50 variants of a model,\nthe one that worked is in a Jupyter notebook that you accidentally overwrote.\nExperiment tracking turns experiments into reproducible, comparable artifacts."
    },
